 "status": "draft: written 17 Nov 2026 offline for the Grade 7 pilot; not yet checked by a Kenyan maths teacher; not loaded by the live tutor",
 "sources": [],
 "notes": "Official outcomes a to i are tested; j (using IT devices) and k (recognising use) are left out. Profit and loss from buying and selling prices and extra costs; percentage profit and loss on the buying price; discount, percentage discount, the marked price worked back from the price paid, and discounts one after another; commission and basic salary; reading utility bills (meter readings, bands, fixed charges, tokens) and shop receipts; preparing a bill; postage by mass bands; mobile money services and transactions with their charges. Every table of charges in the families is an illustration, never a real price list. Grade 6 found buying and selling prices, profit and loss; Grade 5 did budgets, receipts and digital transfers.",
 "skills": [
  {
   "skill": "MATH.G7.MEASUR.MONEY.PROFIT_AND_LOSS",
